  │  │     Client Name                                         │    │
  │  │     Tagline: One-line project description               │    │
  │  │                                                         │    │
  │  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │
  │                                                                  │
  │  ┌──────────────────────┐   ┌──────────────────────┐            │
  │  │                      │   │                      │            │
  │  │  [PROJECT IMAGE]     │   │  [PROJECT IMAGE]     │            │
  │  │                      │   │                      │            │
  │  │  Client Name         │   │  Client Name         │            │
  │  │  Project tagline     │   │  Project tagline     │            │
  │  │                      │   │                      │            │
  │  └──────────────────────┘   └──────────────────────┘            │
  │                                                                  │
  │                    [ View All Work → ]                           │
  │                                                                  │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Card Behavior:
  - Hover: image scales up 5% smoothly, overlay appears
  - Overlay shows: project tags, "View Project →"
  - Cards have subtle rounded corners (radius-xl)
  - Images are high-quality, full-bleed within card

  Content Strategy:
  - Show 3 projects max on homepage (quality > quantity)
  - First project = full-width hero card (most impressive)
  - Next two = side-by-side grid
  - Each has: image, client name, service tags, year, one-line description

  Animation:
  - Section heading fades in on scroll
  - Cards stagger in one-by-one (200ms delay each)
  - Parallax: images move slightly slower than cards during scroll

  Psychology:
  - Large imagery = premium perception
  - Service tags = "they do exactly what I need"
  - Limited selection = curated, not desperate
  - "View All Work →" = there's more (abundance signal)

  File: src/components/sections/featured-work.tsx
  Dependencies: src/content/projects.ts, src/components/shared/project-card.tsx
  Estimated time: 3-4 hours


