  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Card Behavior:
  - Accordion/expandable list style (NOT a grid of cards)
  - Each row: number, title, short description, arrow icon
  - Hover: row highlights with subtle purple tint, arrow slides right
  - Click/tap: expands to show more detail or navigates to service page
  - Active state: purple left border accent

  Animation:
  - Each service row slides in from the left, staggered
  - Numbers count up briefly when section enters viewport

  Psychology:
  - Numbered list = organized, methodical, professional
  - Accordion style (like MadeByShape) = modern, clean
  - Short descriptions = easy to scan
  - Arrow → = "learn more" without cluttering with buttons
  - Conversational descriptions, not jargon

  File: src/components/sections/services-overview.tsx
  Dependencies: src/content/services.ts
  Estimated time: 2-3 hours


