──────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 8: BLOG / INSIGHTS PREVIEW
  Role: Establish thought leadership
──────────────────────────────────────────────

  Layout:
  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │                                                                  │
  │  From Our Studio                           [ View All Posts → ]  │
  │                                                                  │
  │  ┌────────────────┐  ┌────────────────┐  ┌────────────────┐    │
  │  │  [Image]       │  │  [Image]       │  │  [Image]       │    │
  │  │                │  │                │  │                │    │
  │  │  Category      │  │  Category      │  │  Category      │    │
  │  │  Post Title    │  │  Post Title    │  │  Post Title    │    │
  │  │  3 min read    │  │  5 min read    │  │  4 min read    │    │
  │  └────────────────┘  └────────────────┘  └────────────────┘    │
  │                                                                  │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Behavior:
  - 3 latest posts in a horizontal row
  - Hover: image lifts with shadow, title underlines
  - Mobile: horizontal scroll or stacked
  - Each card links to the full blog post

  Psychology:
  - "We share knowledge" = generous, authoritative
  - "3 min read" = commitment clarity
  - Categories = organized expertise

  File: src/components/sections/blog-preview.tsx
  Estimated time: 1.5 hours


──────────────────────────────────────────────
  SECTION 9: CTA BANNER
  Role: The final conversion push
──────────────────────────────────────────────

  Layout:
  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │
  │  │                                                          │   │
  │  │          Have a project in mind?                         │   │
  │  │          Let's make it happen.                           │   │
  │  │                                                          │   │
  │  │          [ Start Your Project → ]                        │   │
  │  │                                                          │   │
  │  │          or email us: hello@rapsora.com                  │   │
  │  │                                                          │   │
  │  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Behavior:
  - Full-width section with gradient or brand-colored background
  - Purple gradient → dark (light mode) or purple gradient → lighter (dark mode)
  - Single, prominent CTA button
  - Email below as low-friction alternative
  - Subtle animated background (gradient shift or particles)

  Psychology:
  - Appears AFTER all trust has been built
  - Simple ask = no form friction yet, just "start a conversation"
  - Email fallback = for people who hate forms
  - Warm, inviting tone ("Let's make it happen")

  File: src/components/sections/cta-banner.tsx
  Estimated time: 1 hour


